# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Keluaran tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), baris-baharu.
Keluaran tulis: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-baharu.
Keluaran tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), baris-baharu.
Keluaran tulis: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-baharu.
Keluaran tulis: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), baris-baharu.
Keluaran tulis: ([''] tccompare: ['']), baris-baharu.
